--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Levels_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a02e01ee9c8597e479b3ddb25f58e717, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 72150890814558208
    m_Localized: "Bl\xF6dmeyer & Sons (no sons)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890860695552
    m_Localized: a pallet of valves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890860695553
    m_Localized: Welcome. Your Wrap does one thing. Do that one thing. Set the console anywhere; there is no office.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889856
    m_Localized: The Lighthouse Keepers' Union
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889857
    m_Localized: one bulb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889858
    m_Localized: The star is not a planet. It bends the same way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889859
    m_Localized: The star is a source too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889860
    m_Localized: Strait & Narrow Ltd.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889861
    m_Localized: a wide load
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889862
    m_Localized: The Wrap takes as well as gives. A smaller world is a wider door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889863
    m_Localized: Shrink the rock, not the cargo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889864
    m_Localized: Madame Fink's Discount Gravity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889865
    m_Localized: a piano
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889866
    m_Localized: The Wrap is yours to place. Where you work is a decision. Make it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889867
    m_Localized: Now move it. Where is a choice. Works everywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889868
    m_Localized: The Third Best Bakery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889869
    m_Localized: a wedding cake, still warm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889870
    m_Localized: The Wrap is yours to place. Use it more than once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889871
    m_Localized: Several zones. Place it, scale them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889872
    m_Localized: Nobody & Co.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889873
    m_Localized: a body (a funeral)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889874
    m_Localized: The field is free. The Wrap is not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889875
    m_Localized: Use what is already there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889876
    m_Localized: The Inheritance of Mr. Fink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889877
    m_Localized: the last of something
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889878
    m_Localized: This is the one the manual was written for. Welcome, new employee. There has not been a new employee in eleven years. There is still no office.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889879
    m_Localized: "\u2026Good luck."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889884
    m_Localized: Contract closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889885
    m_Localized: The bulb is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889886
    m_Localized: The wide load is through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889887
    m_Localized: The piano is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889888
    m_Localized: The cake arrived still warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889889
    m_Localized: The body is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889890
    m_Localized: The inheritance is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889891
    m_Localized: The bulb is still out there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889892
    m_Localized: Too much rock in the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889893
    m_Localized: The piano is lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889894
    m_Localized: The cake went cold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889895
    m_Localized: The field won.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889896
    m_Localized: Mr. Fink is still waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399591899136
    m_Localized: "Bl\xF6dmeyer has the valves."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230784
    m_Localized: I'm Jim. This is Our Space Corp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230785
    m_Localized: We do this one at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230786
    m_Localized: The Keepers say it's the right colour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230787
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230788
    m_Localized: Strait & Narrow measured it twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230789
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230790
    m_Localized: Madame Fink says it plays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230791
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230792
    m_Localized: The Third Best Bakery says it's the best they've done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230793
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230794
    m_Localized: Nobody & Co. says the funeral can start on time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230795
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230796
    m_Localized: Mr. Fink's estate says there's nothing else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230797
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy. For now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230798
    m_Localized: The console stays where it is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230799
    m_Localized: Today the space. Tomorrow the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230801
    m_Localized: That is every contract we have.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230802
    m_Localized: The tech team says more are coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230803
    m_Localized: Get some sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73365399642230804
    m_Localized: "> MORE CONTRACTS IN THE MAKING\n> REPLAY A JOB FOR 3 STARS"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
